# The resulting star — end to end

## Four steps in → a star out

```
     DIM_DATE      DIM_CUSTOMER
          \          /
DIM_CHANNEL—FACT_SALES—DIM_PRODUCT
          /          \
   DIM_PROMOTION   (order_id = degenerate)
```
- **Process** → the fact · **Grain** → its rows
- **Dimensions** → the points · **Facts** → the centre

## Prove it answers the business

```sql
SELECT d.month_name, p.product_line, c.region, SUM(f.line_total)
FROM   fact_sales f
JOIN   dim_date d … JOIN dim_product p … JOIN dim_customer c
GROUP BY d.month_name, p.product_line, c.region
```
- "Revenue by month, product line, region" — one fact, three joins
- Measures from the **centre**, slices from the **points**
